																		"text": {
																			"value_i18n": {
																				"en_US": "For over 6 years, Courspectra has evolved through number of iterations across multiple industries, domains, demonstrations and enhancements to achieve simplicity and intuitiveness.<br>\n<br>\nA learning solution that fits into almost all domains that require online learning from anywhere&nbsp; - from instructor led training in a center or scheduling a sports session in a playground.<br>\n<br>\nAs a platform owner you can host online courses in structured manner and design personalized learning plan for each individual.<br>\n<br>\nContinuous assessment and evaluation of your team, follow-up and training is the key to improving the overall capacity of the organization or team.<br>\n<br>\nMobile app support for learners and instructors makes the entire learning process simple and accessible."
																			}
																		}
																	}
