																"text": {
																	"value_i18n": {
																		"en_US": "<h2>Highlights</h2>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Blended learning platform to manage offline and online training at one place</li>\n\t<li>Site builder and CMS capabilities to create micro-sites for every training program</li>\n\t<li>Quick availability of webinars to all users</li>\n\t<li>Multilingual capability to create courses in multiple languages</li>\n\t<li>Ability to upload media content for each language separately</li>\n\t<li>Auto bookmarking and resume feature for last seen video</li>\n\t<li>Realtime suspension of student during examination due to suspicious activity</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;Features</h2>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Course management</li>\n\t<li>Training calendar and attendance</li>\n\t<li>Pre and post assessment</li>\n\t<li>Webinar publishing</li>\n\t<li>User management</li>\n\t<li>Gamification and certification</li>\n\t<li>Buy or sell online course and offline training</li>\n\t<li>Course wise activity tracking</li>\n\t<li>Time-bound assignments and scoring</li>\n\t<li>SSO integration with enterprise AD</li>\n\t<li>Training group management</li>\n</ul>"
																	}
